title: Day01EveningPart02_01
---
<<if $Shelly_inviteToLunch>>
    Marvin: Hey Jerome, we were waiting for you to say Goodbye.
    <<if $Shelly_likePoint >= 2>>
        Shelly: Yeah. This marvin isn't so bad after all.
        Me: Huh, I wouldn't expect you two to get along very well.
        Shelly: Well, he's a geek and I'm a geek.
        Me: Wait, a geek?
        Marvin: Yeah, I studied Computer Science before coming here.
        -> Oh wow, I didn't know that. That's awesome.
            <<set $Marvin_likePoint += 1>>
        -> Oh, so you're a nerd? I like nerds.
            <<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
                <<set $Marvin_lovePoint += 1>>
            <<endif>>
        <<if $Marvin_lovePoint >= 1>>
            Marvin: Oh....uhh, I..see.
            Shelly: Looks like someone is flustered.
        <<else>>
            Marvin: Haha!
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
    Shelly: Alright, I'll just say bye here.
    Marvin: Yeah, i have to get going as well.
    Me: Bye Shelly and Marvin.
    Marvin: See you tomorrow Jerome.
    Shelly: See ya.
<<else>>
    Me: Oh? Didn't know you two know each other.
    Shelly: Not really. It just so happens that we both are good at math.
    Shelly: So he decided to ask me about something.
    Marvin: It was nothing big.
    Marvin: Anyways, we should get going now.
    Shelly: Same. Well, goodbye you two.
    Me: Bye Shelly.
    <<set_object_inactive InteractDialogueTrigger01/Shelly>>
    <<wait_for_crossfade>>
    *Shelly left*
    Marvin: Hey, Jerome. Thanks for today.
    <<if $Marvin_likePoint >= 2>>
        Marvin: I know we will get through it together again.
    <<endif>>
    <<if $Marvin_lovePoint >= 1>>
        Marvin: Thank you for being proud of me.
    <<endif>>
    Marvin: See you tomorrow.
    Me: See you Marvin.
<<endif>>
<<set_object_inactive InteractDialogueTrigger01>>
<<wait_for_crossfade>>
<<set_object_active "Scene Loader">>
===
